      ],
      "source": "https://hl.mecknc.gov/Properties/Designated-Historic-Landmarks/charlotte/highland-park-villa-heights",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Villa Heights once hosted a small farmers’ market that supplied fresh produce to downtown Durham before the rise of chain supermarkets.",
